      "parameters": {
        "content": "Academy Section 2 Sales Data Pipeline\n\nCreated by: Syed Anas Ali Shah\nDate: 04.08.2026\n\nThis workflow creates a complete sales data pipeline with multiple branches to process, analyze, and report sales data. It retrieves order information, calculates order totals, filters delivered orders, generates regional sales summaries, and prepares management reports. The workflow validates data through HTTP requests and demonstrates branching logic for operations, finance, and reporting use cases.\n\nPart of: n8n Foundations Course – Section 2",
